#: scenario6:scenario6_610A1B58_438B_4014_9854_20954784BA90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 127c8f3290c8615d9c1f093aa4bc3e1cee385e3f1cf51eff49a548537074a07f
#. default-sha256: 2b92aef0c45521e4ca28e5c1a670bf1f27a1ab99723115c149ffae2381faaf9f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_610A1B58_438B_4014_9854_20954784BA90"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl lay so quietly in her bed I could not tell whether she was asleep or "
"awake. ⟪k:1⟫Even the sound of her breathing was too faint to hear."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi giaceva così immobile e silenziosa sul suo letto, da non "
"permettermi di capire se fosse sveglia o se stesse dormendo. ⟪k:1⟫Perfino il suo respiro era "
"troppo debole per riuscire a sentirlo."

#: scenario6:scenario6_50E70F20_3762_4C28_9673_209A6BEC3F91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
