msgid "⟪k:0⟫Standing over her, looking down at her,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mentre la fissavo, in piedi davanti a lei,"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9BD8D0C9_A667_42CB_BBA6_176213ECF1A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eeec703216dd2186cd1ce1bef46420280a96eb3280f9e2348cead1c571e9f29b
#. default-sha256: 5848df99c200b5318d4dd9bc9934b7a111fe6d19426e747817017fe03224a32a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9BD8D0C9_A667_42CB_BBA6_176213ECF1A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫the locked-away despair and wails of lamentation I thought myself no longer capable of came "
"bubbling back to the surface."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫l’angoscia e il dolore che pensavo di non riuscire più a provare riemersero in superficie."

#: scenario6:scenario6_DFD9106B_4AC6_4564_AB5F_2270AE250704
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 607aaa73fe0d1a6466dfd442c9ba06ef2cdf0ab11012dd48ce826b48f7132394
#. default-sha256: b40222c38a879c9d2d28f1bf457bde9725511cdd150bea9d94938001cc7d3d35
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DFD9106B_4AC6_4564_AB5F_2270AE250704"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But can you honestly blame me?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had been waiting for Michel for so long.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"She was the one thing holding me up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma puoi davvero biasimarmi?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Avevo atteso Michel così a lungo.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Lei era "
"l’unica cosa che mi sorreggesse."

#: scenario6:scenario6_51246C68_E2BD_4555_94E1_30C4101097DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd97592f2fcfc87ba9e4b21ba47134b81714f24b3bfae7b4188f64e6271726ba
#. default-sha256: 8fd17a4bbc3fed07823acebc73fff15c5c29c075cb9aff142a4fda08220ea960
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_51246C68_E2BD_4555_94E1_30C4101097DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was the only thing keeping my broken self from falling apart completely. ⟪k:1⟫Yet she "
"claimed not to remember me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’unica cosa che potesse impedire al mio ego infranto di crollare definitivamente. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Eppure affermava di non ricordarsi di me."

#: scenario6:scenario6_7E405E73_9B4D_43A5_8BB6_676F78E81FCF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 621d4c2f1205f0cfa90535f073b0e0ec662f12bdbdce3a44898204d9d6193db5
#. default-sha256: c8d273c8f8f7d704cf759150b065d15850136123bdb759f6dad4ce29e37fd72d
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_7E405E73_9B4D_43A5_8BB6_676F78E81FCF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Did you pity her, having to go through tragedy after tragedy?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But every time she "
"showed up, she said she did not know me,⟪k:3⟫bringing me more and more grief."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Provi pena per lei, costretta ad attraversare una tragedia dopo l’altra?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eppure "
"ogni volta che si presentava, diceva di non conoscermi, ferendomi, ancora e ancora."

#: scenario6:scenario6_B7B01D9B_3ACD_4944_B84F_F773C395BE04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c50c8bc7e1945c2b0b4362595ed5a692fea0fc83eac1c60c8920be082021ea85
#. default-sha256: de7636d93ca51e02340c20126461fc994ae085f270b956038bed9aadee716607
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_B7B01D9B_3ACD_4944_B84F_F773C395BE04"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had been waiting for hundreds of years. ⟪k:1⟫Waiting for her for so long, my mind slipping "
"away with every passing day, waiting and waiting and wait—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avevo atteso centinaia di anni. ⟪k:1⟫L’avevo aspettata per così tanto tempo,⟪k:2⟫che col "
"passare dei giorni perdevo sempre più il senno, aspettando e aspettando e aspettando—"

#: scenario6:scenario6_F70E0AF7_C067_49B9_B384_3C6084E0CCFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
