msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I have to be careful, or I’ll slip back to what I was then.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If you weren’t here "
"holding my hand now, I..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Devo stare attenta, o ritornerò ad essere quella di un tempo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se non ci fossi tu "
"qui a tenermi per mano, io..."

